    "sections": {
        "description": "Fertility Clinic is a warm and modern block theme for fertility clinics, IVF centres, gynaecologists, obstetricians, midwives, maternity and women's health practices. A deep navy and soft coral palette, an elegant Philosopher serif paired with clean DM Sans body text and generous whitespace create a calm, reassuring first impression. The homepage opens with a contact info bar and floating navy navigation, followed by a full width hero with a soft white fade, an about section with overlapping images, inline statistics and a video button, a grid of the latest fertility guides and an FAQ section with expandable answers beside an image and badge. The navy footer includes treatment and clinic links, contact details and search. Built entirely with core blocks and full site editing, every color, font, template and pattern can be customized from the Site Editor. Includes ready-made patterns, style variations and a fully responsive, accessible layout."
    },
